<title>
Differential Disassembly and Reassembly
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5206017">Manual Transaxle Assembly Disassembly and Reassembly</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5206030">Differential Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5206031001">
<title>
Disassembly
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Support differential case with soft jawed vise (1) and remove final gear bolts (2), and then remove final gear (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFP80A540096.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.136mm" ver = "01" gw = "191" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove left side bearing (1) using special tool, bearing puller (2) and hydraulic press.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B046">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09913-84510">
09913–84510
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL70B520034.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.501mm" ver = "02" gw = "164" gh = "135"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove right side bearing in the same manner as in Step 2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove differential pinion shaft pin using special tool and hammer and then disassemble component parts.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B047">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09922-85811">
09922–85811
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I5RW0A520046.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "47.106mm" ver = "01" gw = "107" gh = "117"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
