<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5206031002">
<title>
Reassembly
</title>
<ptxt>
Judging from abnormality noted before disassembly and what is found through visual check of component parts after disassembly, prepare replacing parts and proceed to reassembly. Check that all parts are clean.
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install differential pinion, differential pinion washer, side gear (1), spring washer (2), side gear washer (3) and pinion shaft to differential case (4), and measure thrust play of differential side gear as follows.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B048">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09900-20607">
09900–20607
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B049">
<s-part>
(B)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09900-20701">
09900–20701
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B050">
<s-part>
(C)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09952-06010">
09952–06010
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Hold differential assembly with soft jawed vise and apply measuring tip of dial gauge to side gear as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Move side gear up and down by hand and or flat-bladed screw driver (5) read dial gauge.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Differential side gear thrust play
</title>
<ptxt>
0.03 – 0.31 mm (0.001 – 0.012 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A523034.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "91.849mm" ver = "01" gw = "224" gh = "244"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Right side
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Left side
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
If measured value is not as specified, select suitable side gear washer from the following available sizes, install it and check the thrust play again.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Available side gear washer thickness
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "1.708in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.708in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.60 mm (0.024 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.80 mm (0.031 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.65 mm (0.026 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.85 mm (0.033 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.70 mm (0.028 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.90 mm (0.035 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
0.75 mm (0.030 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install new differential pinion shaft pin (1) from right side until depth “a” becomes 0.20 – 2.20 mm (0.008 – 0.086 in.) as shown using special tool.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B051">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09922-85811">
09922–85811
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ICV00Q320003.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "43.504mm" ver = "01" gw = "93" gh = "107"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
